{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a:1","run_id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a","timestamp":"2026-09-04T23:23:25.923Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"7e146fd8","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"warning","text":"The service hardcodes the coupon code 'FREESCOOP' directly in validation logic. Configuration data like coupon codes should be isolated in a single obvious place or injected via the Store to prevent silent coupling and drift between code and data. The file should either fetch valid codes from the Store or import them from a dedicated configuration module.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-a108ea","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"introduced","before_run_id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a","resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a:2","run_id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a","timestamp":"2026-09-04T23:23:25.923Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service lacks a doc comment stating its purpose and enumerating domain failure modes. The file must add a doc comment above the run function that clearly explains what the service does and lists all possible domain failures so callers can handle errors without reading the body.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-2559f7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"resolved","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":"Sebastian Scholl"}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a:3","run_id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a","timestamp":"2026-09-04T23:23:25.923Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service performs direct I/O via console.log('redeeming ${input.coupon} at ${parlor.name}') instead of using the injected Store dependency. All I/O must be mediated by Store methods. The file must remove the console.log call or replace it with appropriate Store-mediated logging.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-6e307b","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"resolved","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":"Sebastian Scholl"}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a:4","run_id":"20260904T232325922Z-6379521a","timestamp":"2026-09-04T23:23:25.923Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The error message for unrecognized coupons ('coupon \"${input.coupon}\" is not recognized — codes are case-sensitive') is not fully actionable. While it mentions case-sensitivity, it doesn't tell the consumer what valid codes would be accepted. The file must specify what coupon codes are valid (e.g., 'only \"FREESCOOP\" is accepted at this time').","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-b951db","axiom_version":2,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"resolved","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":"Sebastian Scholl"}
